ng .itp templates per the skill's `scripts/bda/simulators/data/opls/README.md` (gromacs engine only) 103	  - `gmx mdrun failed: ...` / `gmx trjconv failed: ...` → troubleshoot per trailing stderr content 104	 105	## render — HTML report 106	 107	``` 108	bda render --case-dir CASE_DIR [--out OUT] 109	``` 110	 111	- Reads `<case_dir>/log.jsonl` (entry 0 criteria + all action entries), produces a self-contained HTML (task overview / iteration trajectory / funnel statistics / stage results / true DFT-MD endorsement / final recommendation / design notes — seven sections), written to `<case_dir>/<out>` (default `report.html`) 112	- No log.jsonl → renders an empty report; no corresponding entry → section shows "no data yet" 113	- Errors: no custom validation; log-line JSON parse failure → traceback pointing at the line number 114	- Where used: last closing step; report content deterministically generated from log.jsonl, no extra LLM calls 115	 116	## run-comp — electrode composition screening (CHGNet periodic relaxation) 117	 118	``` 119	bda run-comp --in IN --out OUT 120	``` 121	 122	- **Environment requirement**: CUDA torch (GPU relaxation ~20 s/state); CPU torch relaxation does not converge (measured). Local `.venv` is CPU torch — use `D:/anaconda/envs/py312/python.exe -m bda run-comp ...` (py312 has chgnet/pymatgen/ase + torch 2.13.0+cu126) 123	- Input `--in`: `{"candidates": [{"formula": "Li(Ni0.7Mn0.05Co0.05Si0.1Mg0.1)O2", "name": "NMC-SiMg"}]}` — NMC811 lattice site substitution; TM fractions must sum to 1 124	- Output: `{"baseline": {NMC811 energy + Li metal reference}, "candidates": [{formula, realized_tm_counts, avg_voltage_v, capacity_mah_g, e_full_ev, e_delith_ev, converged, rel_stability_ev_atom}], "calibration_note"}` 125	- Definitions (stated honestly, written to the report): 126	  - Average voltage = −[E(Li_x2)−E(Li_x1)−n_removed·E_Li]/n_removed (x∈[0.3,1], includes Li metal reference; NMC811 self-calibration ≈3.82 vs literature 3.8 V) 127	  - Capacity = 0.