er set, matching basis (system description ↔ anchor table/parameter key verification), source marked `baseline`** — base determination is deterministic (anchor table mapping); the same system description must land on the same parameter set; do not merely write "materials use system baseline" without basis. 113	 114	**Stage 2 Material Design** (fast loop, zero true compute, only with `start_stage: 2`). 115	 116	**Candidate types** (propose from the table each round; write `llm_reason` decision rationale in the propose entry): 117	 118	| Candidate type | Proposal form (propose candidates object) | Screening | Bridge into Stage 3 | 119	|---|---|---|---| 120	| Molecule (additive) | `{"smiles", "name", "role"}` — free generation (agent's own chemistry knowledge) | Three-model funnel (below) | Parameter bridge (props) | 121	| System | `{"base": "Prada2013", "name": "systemLFP", "role"}` | Skips molecular screening, direct Stage 3 simulation | `--base <system>` | 122	| Coating/dopant | Molecular-isomorphic, role noting "positive coating agent" | **Inorganic ionic solids skip the funnel** (ML potentials/xtb unreliable) → Stage 3 aging; organic precursors go through the funnel as usual | SEI/cracking parameter bridge | 123	| Electrode composition | `{"comp": {"formula", "name"}, "role"}` | `run-comp` (CHGNet periodic relaxation) | Self-built parameter set script (constant-OCP approximation) | 124	| Solvent/salt formulation | `{"struct": {<PyBaMM parameter name>: new value}, "name", "role"}` | No molecular screening | Parameter bridge (transport parameters) | 125	 126	**Molecular candidate funnel flow** (hard elimination lines + three-model heterogeneous voting): 127	``` 128	1. Run for real, in order: run-mlp(mace) → run-mlp(chgnet) → run-xtb (same candidate list) 129	2. Hard elimination lines (against criteria.stage1 in entry 0): 130	   - mace metrics.converged not true → eliminate 131	   - metrics.energy_ev > max_energy_ev (default 0.0 eV) → eliminate 132	   - xtb metrics.h